  "label": "Activism Risk Metaphor mapped onto Pride Celebration Scene",
  "description": "The text 'you either die a hero, or live long enough to become the villain' (text_chunk) is mapped onto the visual scene of the Pride Celebration (pride_celebration). The metaphor describes the risks faced by activists, and the visual of two joyful individuals at a Pride event, a movement rooted in activism, serves as the visual instantiation of this metaphor. The celebratory scene, while joyful, is contextually linked to the historical and ongoing struggles of the LGBTQ+ movement, making the metaphor applicable to the visual material.",
